-- statement:
--   # Block-0 gate slot tables
--
--   This pack stores `srcS_vals`, the 1301-row `gateSlotCert` of block-0 gate slots, the 14 chunk lists, and the abstract map/membership lemmas used to prove slot owners. The `rfl` map certificates and the owner glue live in later packs. Prefix / block-0 helper only; not a full-word W1F certificate.
-- source:
--   IntMul Kappa R8 Bit Oppbank FormalOK: block-0 slot tables. Prefix / block-0 pack only; not a full-word W1F certificate.

/-!
Slim helper: block-0 gate slot owners (srcS / leafHi of tp and tb) via 100-row `rfl`
map equalities against srcS_vals. No ∈-decide on the 1170- or 1301-long lists.
Standalone; no QHNet / Mathlib.
-/
